00:00:32.676 --> 00:00:35.460
race. The race was going to raise money for a homeless

12
00:00:35.461 --> 00:00:38.671
shelter. Runners from all over the city were

13
00:00:38.672 --> 00:00:41.739
there. Roxy, Terrell, and Mara

14
