marathon!" Mara rolled her

19
00:00:55.107 --> 00:00:58.455
eyes. Then she stood up and marched in

20
00:00:58.456 --> 00:01:01.216
place. "What are you doing?" Jack

21
00:01:01.217 --> 00:01:04.688
asked. "I'm warming up my legs," Mara

22
00:01:04.689 --> 00:01:06.577
said. "My uncle is a

23
00:01:06.578 --> 00:01:09.229
runner. He taught me this warm-up

24
00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:13.454
exercise. He said it's important to move your legs before a

25
00:01:13.455 --> 00:01:15.929
race." Terrell got up and marched in

26
00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:17.566
place. Roxy did

27
00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:22.192
