34
00:01:40.295 --> 00:01:42.635
Jack ran fast.

35
00:01:42.636 --> 00:01:46.528
Soon he was far ahead of his friends.

36
00:01:46.529 --> 00:01:49.275
But then he slowed down.

37
00:01:49.276 --> 00:01:53.000
Roxy, Terrell, and Mara caught up to him.

38
00:01:53.001 --> 00:01:55.476
