43
00:02:10.299 --> 00:02:15.097
Jack groaned as Mara ran ahead of him.

44
00:02:15.098 --> 00:02:19.586
Terrell smiled. "I know who could easily win this race!"

45
00:02:19.587 --> 00:02:22.067
Roxy laughed.

46
00:02:22.068 --> 00:02:26.442
"Rocket Girl has more important things to do, Terrell.

47
00:02:26.443 --> 00:02:30.686
But you're right. She could easily win this race!"

48
00:02:30.687 --> 00:02:34.904
The two friends laughed.

49
00:02:34.905 --> 00:02:36.938
Roxy's watch beeped.

50
00:02:36.939 --> 00:02:39.325
She moved over to the side.

51
00:02:39.326 --> 00:02:41.084
Runners ran past her.

52
00:02:41.085 --> 00:02:47.086
She pretended to tie her shoe.

53
00:02:47.087 --> 00:02:49.533
"Mayor Bloom?" Roxy whispered.

54
00:02:49.534 --> 00:02:51.178
"What's wrong?"

55
00:02:51.179 --> 00:02:53.274
Mayor Bloom scratched his head.

56
00:02:53.275 --> 00:02:55.537
"I'm not sure, Rocket Girl.

57
00:02:55.538 --> 00:02:58.197
The police got a lot of calls this morning.

58
00:02:58.198 --> 00:03:01.363
