59
00:03:01.364 --> 00:03:04.536
"Are people getting robbed?" Roxy asked.

60
00:03:04.537 --> 00:03:06.312
Mayor Bloom shrugged.

61
00:03:06.313 --> 00:03:10.095
"Nobody knows. I need you to go to Gem's Jewelry.

62
00:03:10.096 --> 00:03:11.858
The owner just called.

63
00:03:11.859 --> 00:03:15.285
She said all of her jewelry suddenly disappeared."

64
00:03:15.286 --> 00:03:17.496
"Okay, Mayor," Roxy said.

65
00:03:17.497 --> 00:03:21.878
"I'm on my way!"

